==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|run<,,ran,run> aground}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive|of a vessel}} To be [[immobilize]]d by [[water]] too [[shallow]] to allow it to [[float]].
#: {{ux|en|The ship '''ran aground''' and had to be towed back out to sea.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To cause (a vessel) to be [[immobilize]]d by [[water]] too [[shallow]] to allow it to [[float]].
#: {{ux|en|The drunken [[helmsman]] '''ran''' the ship '''aground.'''}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|beach}}
* {{l|en|ground}}

